    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_linseed_cake",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_LinseedCake_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "The pressed flax seed left in the bag after the oil is out, packed into a dry, oily cake. Crumble it into a placed Dry Fodder and the cattle get more out of it."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_linseed_cake",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_LinseedCake_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Made by:</b> pressing Flax Seeds on a placed Oil Press, beside the Linseed Oil.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Drag it onto a placed Dry Fodder with <b>Add to Fodder</b>: the fodder gains 6 Amount and 25 Nutrition (Amount stops at 12, Nutrition at 100) and the cake is used up. A fodder that has run out is gone, so add the cake before it empties."
    },
